# LeakSanitizer suppressions of the sanitizer run (bxc-pki
# `python deploy/build/linux/dev.py asan`, BTD-205).
#
# Third-party leaks only: Qt, OpenSSL provider and library init,
# fontconfig and the like. One entry per line, "leak:<function or
# library>", with a comment above it that names the reason. A leak in
# fork code is never suppressed; it is fixed (BTD-200 and later tickets).
#
# The first run (2026-10-30, service and CLI tests on bxc-main c6ed3d13)
# found no third-party leak, so there is no entry yet.
